Zotero-RefFlow-Skills

Zotero Input includes a modified version of the nature-citation search and
export script from nature-skills by Yuan1z0825 and its contributors.

Upstream project: https://github.com/Yuan1z0825/nature-skills
Upstream commit: 66668aea4f8cbdfd6791bbeac5aed53f233eac88
Upstream file: skills/nature-citation/scripts/nature_citation.py
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0

Zotero-RefFlow-Skills modified the script's journal scope defaults, XML parsing,
report labels and HTML browser output. The modified file is distributed as
zotero-input/scripts/_vendor/nature_citation.py in this repository and as
scripts/_vendor/nature_citation.py in the standalone Zotero Input directory.
